    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "paragraph_id": "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:scene-001:paragraph-00",
        "text": "王林咬紧牙关，沿着陡峭的石阶小径一步步向上爬行，汗水浸透了衣衫。",
        "claimed_fact_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-001"
        ],
        "claimed_event_ids": []
      },
      {
        "paragraph_id": "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:scene-001:paragraph-01",
        "text": "他感到双腿如灌铅般沉重，正咬牙坚持时，忽然瞥见前方一个少年踩空，惊呼着坠落下去。",
        "claimed_fact_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-002",
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-003"
        ],
        "claimed_event_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:event-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_id": "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:scene-001:paragraph-02",
        "text": "王林感到双腿如灌铅，再也无法前进一步。这一刻黑衣中年人冷冷宣布时间已到，只有三人合格，其余失败。王林眼前一黑，身体软倒，昏迷过去。",
        "claimed_fact_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-002",
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-005",
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-006"
        ],
        "claimed_event_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:event-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "paragraph_id": "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:scene-001:paragraph-03",
        "text": "昏迷前，他隐约听到那个面色蜡黄中年人发出一声叹息，低沉而惋惜：“可惜资质太过普通。”那声音仿佛穿透了意识，随即他便彻底失去了知觉。",
        "claimed_fact_ids": [
          "ErGen/work-001/0004:chunk-01:fact-004"
        ],
        "claimed_event_ids": []
      }
    ]
  },
